You need to set the default runtime for your daemon to nvidia.

This is usually set in `/etc/docker/daemon.json` with the following script (please note that the `runtimes` part should already present and does not need to be changed):
```json
{
    "default-runtime": "nvidia",
    "runtimes": {
        "nvidia": {
            "path": "THE PATH TO THE NVIDIA RUNTIME",
            "runtimeArgs": []
        }
    }
}
```

